    "description": "You treat the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Wan-Shen\" title=\"Wan-Shen\">Wan-Shen</a> as a Medium Weapon instead of a Large Weapon. You can use the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Pin\" title=\"Pin\">Pin</a> and <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Trip\" title=\"Trip\">Trip</a> feats with a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Wan-Shen\" title=\"Wan-Shen\">Wan-Shen</a>, substituting your attack bonus with the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Wan-Shen\" title=\"Wan-Shen\">Wan-Shen</a> for your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Grapple\" title=\"Grapple\">Grapple</a> check. You must have your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Wan-Shen\" title=\"Wan-Shen\">Wan-Shen</a> in hand to use this Talent.<br><br>In addition, when you use the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Wan-Shen\" title=\"Wan-Shen\">Wan-Shen</a> as a Double Weapon, you reduce all attack penalties for attacking with both ends of the weapon by 1.",
